Port the MindOne GKI-6.12 copy of MediaTek's ECCCI modem stack (ccci_util_lib,
ccmni, ccci_md_all, ccci_ccif, ccci_dpmaif) to Linux 7.0 and the Q25 boot chain.

Applies with -p1 inside a tree holding the files of eccci-files.txt, copied
(with symlinks) from iasnezhkov/android_kernel_ikko_mindone 9cd73c15
mindone/modules. Adds the Kbuild files, q25_ccci_smc (the LK CCCI SiP mapping
for a BL31 that never saw MTK_SIP_KERNEL_BOOT) and 7.0 API fixes.

